## No Duplication

Before writing any helper, check `databases_core.ml` for:
- `Utilities.apply_to_header_if_some` — conditional header addition
- `add_header` — unconditional header addition
- `handle_response` — unwraps timeout/http-error/ok
- `make_uri` — builds the HTTPS URI
- `header_path_of_path` — strips leading `/` for auth headers
- `with_throttle_retry` — handles 429 and connection errors with retry
- `result_or_error_with_result` — maps expected status code to Ok, others to Error
- `Utilities.take_first` — chunk splitting for parallel batch operations

