## ATD / JSON
- JSON types are defined in `src/cosmos/json.atd`; regenerate with `dune build` after changes
- Use generated `Json_converter_j` (serialisers) and `Json_converter_t` (types) — do not hand-roll JSON for types that can be expressed in ATD
- Hand-rolled JSON (via `Printf.sprintf {|..|}`) is acceptable only for dynamic/variable-shape payloads like batch request bodies

---

## Testing
- Unit tests for pure logic: `test/core/`
- Integration tests: `test/cosmos/` or backend dirs (`test/lwt/`, `test/eio/`)
- New test files must be added to the relevant `dune` stanza
- Never delete or weaken existing tests
- Use `alcotest` (Lwt: `alcotest-lwt`, Eio: `alcotest`)
- Every operation needs at least one error path test (404, 429, timeout, connection refused)
